


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_ecb2d930:



    voice "2FU_0541"
    fumi "「肚子鼓起来了呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_1ce38cc8:


    "火锅见底的时候，文呼了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_17375467:



    voice "2SA_0419"
    sachiko "「啊，最后还有杂烩粥哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_7b54998e:



    voice "2FU_0542"
    fumi "「杂烩粥……很好吃的样子呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_8e32ec05:


    "装杂烩粥的是另一个胃？"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_e74d1fe2:



    voice "2FU_0543"
    fumi "「肚子是满了，但嘴巴还是停不下来」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_efef4f27:


    "文害羞道，但完全是一副要吃的样子。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_50208fae:



    voice "2MI_0542"
    miyako "「就是啊，文！因为好吃而吃个不停的话，之后会很惨的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_6f5c8c01:


    "圣夜子强调道。看来那时的圣诞蛋糕给她造成了相当的心理阴影。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_361b504a:



    voice "2FU_0544"
    fumi "「啊呜！我、我本来想说今天是特别的日子就不算在内了，但还是不行吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_8b1494a8:


    "她似乎误解了圣夜子嘴中的“很惨”。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_c434513e:



    voice "2RI_0685"
    rin "「吃火锅会发热流汗，所以卡路里实际摄取量为零」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_57d2aeee:



    voice "2FU_0545B"
    fumi "「真的吗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_b72faaac:


    "伦又在瞎说了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_d6de2ecf:



    voice "2HI_0669"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_cdea2f28:



    voice "2SA_0420"
    sachiko "「嗯，阳菜亲你干嘛呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_5e0674fe:


    "阳菜时不时回头看向房间角落里堆积的画布。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_3cb49ae1:



    voice "2HI_0670"
    hina "「我想看看伦的画。就是圣诞节之前以伦为模特画的那个」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_b759d685:



    voice "2SA_0421"
    sachiko "「啊啊，那个不在画布里哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_303fddae:


    "祥子站起身，从架子上抽出一本速写本。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_ba5265b4:



    voice "2SA_0422"
    sachiko "「在这」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_7944e7db:



    voice "2HI_0671"
    hina "「涂鸦本？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_0bc0494f:



    voice "2SA_0423"
    sachiko "「啊哈哈，确实也能说是涂鸦吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_944d6c22:


    "阳菜接过速写本，翻开。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_ed69bd6d:


    "铅笔素描的痕迹交错在白纸上。从模特的手脚平衡与头发长短来看，画的确实是伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_1f932adb:


    "画的内容主要是简单的造型以及只有手脚一类部位的写生。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_f337b723:



    voice "2HI_0672"
    hina "「不下流。没有裸体」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_a15cb7de:



    voice "2RI_0686"
    rin "「这不是当然的吗！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_37357b95:



    voice "2SA_0424"
    sachiko "「虽然我是有提过条件的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_481990b4:



    voice "2RI_0687"
    rin "「鬼才会脱！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_158d84c2:



    voice "2HI_0673"
    hina "「和想象中的不太一样。我以为会画的更仔细一些」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_ab8c8c0a:


    "看来阳菜想象的是肖像画一类的画作。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_67252779:



    voice "2SA_0425"
    sachiko "「伦手长腿长身体又软，正好适合代替造型人偶」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_bcb9710b:



    voice "2RI_0688"
    rin "「真失礼啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_3191b7af:



    voice "2SA_0426"
    sachiko "「我明明在夸你啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_adb5c780:



    voice "2RI_0689"
    rin "「听不出来。不过也是多亏了做模特才能换来这个choker啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_e9517a79:


    "伦说着，轻轻扯了扯阳菜的项圈。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_5e7ea3a5:



    voice "2HI_0674"
    hina "「嗯……谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_059eefd5:



    voice "2RI_0690"
    rin "「好好工作的我真棒」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_7a6d336d:



    voice "2HI_0675"
    hina "「祥子姐，我想要这张伦的速写」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_5d3a218a:



    voice "2SA_0427"
    sachiko "「这只是涂鸦诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_9fdd758a:



    voice "2HI_0676"
    hina "「没有啊，我觉得很好看。伦的优点尽收其中」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_ebe6677b:



    voice "2SA_0428"
    sachiko "「哦，赞不绝口啊，多谢多谢。但是我不会外传作品的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_0ea583e9:



    voice "2HI_0677"
    hina "「我会好好珍惜的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_a08297f6:


    "阳菜目不转睛地注视着祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_a21bf761:



    voice "2SA_0429"
    sachiko "「嗯～那和你的choker交换」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_4e1bbd2c:



    voice "2HI_0678"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_e6446539:



    voice "2SA_0430"
    sachiko "「啊，我骗你的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_b09d693e:


    "见阳菜一副要哭的表情，祥子慌了神。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_ce6d3877:



    voice "2HI_0679"
    hina "「……那下次能画我们俩一起的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_c379f1a8:



    voice "2SA_0431"
    sachiko "「裸体的可以吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_c65e6019:



    voice "2HI_0680"
    hina "「和伦一起的话……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_21f94fbe:



    voice "2RI_0691"
    rin "「我才不要！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_04_b89b4713:


    "模特给出了NG（拒绝）。"
